{"seq":1,"slug":"future-async-await","title":"Future 与 async/await","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/future-async-await","wordCount":1109,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"future-与-async-await\">Future 与 async/await</h1><p>Dart 的异步模型建立在<strong>单线程事件循环</strong>之上——所有代码在同一个线程执行，通过 Future 表示「将来会完成的计算」，通过 async/await 语法让异步代码读起来像同步代码。理解事件循环的双队列机制和 Future 的状态转换，是写出高性能、无卡顿 Dart 应用的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先立起本篇的几张底牌，后文所有论证都围绕它们展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>一句话定义</th>\n<th>在本篇中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件循环</td>\n<td>单线程上持续运行、维护双队列的调度器</td>\n<td>一切异步行为的物理基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Microtask</td>\n<td>高优先级队列，每轮全部清空</td>\n<td>饿死 event 队列的性能陷阱源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Event</td>\n<td>低优先级队列，每轮只取一个</td>\n<td>IO、定时器、用户输入的入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Future</td>\n<td>三态且一旦完成即不可变的一次性异步值</td>\n<td>异步计算的核心抽象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>async/await</td>\n<td>编译器把语法糖转换为 Future 链</td>\n<td>让异步代码读起来像同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合器</td>\n<td><code>wait</code>/<code>any</code>/<code>forEach</code>/<code>doWhile</code> 的并发编排</td>\n<td>决定并发窗口大小的杠杆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话串起来：事件循环用双队列定义执行顺序，Future 封装单次异步结果，async/await 是它的语法糖，组合器决定多个 Future 之间是并发还是顺序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件循环的双队列模型\">事件循环的双队列模型</h2><p>Dart 的事件循环在应用的整个生命周期中持续运行。它维护两个队列，处理优先级严格区分：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[同步代码执行完毕] --&gt; B{Microtask 队列为空?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[取出并执行一个 Microtask]&#10;    C --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{Event 队列为空?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[取出并执行一个 Event]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[等待新事件]&#10;    F --&gt; B\">graph TD\n    A[同步代码执行完毕] --&gt; B{Microtask 队列为空?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[取出并执行一个 Microtask]\n    C --&gt; B\n    B --&gt;|是| D{Event 队列为空?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[取出并执行一个 Event]\n    E --&gt; B\n    D --&gt;|是| F[等待新事件]\n    F --&gt; B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>队列</th>\n<th>入队来源</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>典型内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Microtask</td>\n<td><code>Future.then()</code>、<code>scheduleMicrotask()</code>、<code>Future.microtask()</code></td>\n<td>高——每轮全部清空</td>\n<td>Future 完成回调、Stream 监听器通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Event</td>\n<td>Timer、IO 完成、用户输入、<code>Future.delayed()</code></td>\n<td>低——每次取一个</td>\n<td>网络响应、文件读取、定时器触发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键规则：事件循环<strong>先清空所有 microtask</strong>，然后才处理一个 event。这意味着密集的 microtask 调度可能饿死 event 队列——一个常见的性能陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"future-的三态模型\">Future 的三态模型</h2><p>Future 是 Dart 异步计算的核心抽象，它在生命周期中经历三个状态：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Future状态</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Uncompleted（等待中）</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>complete</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Completed with value</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>正常完成</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Completed with error</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>异常完成</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Future状态} = \\begin{cases} \\text{Uncompleted（等待中）} &amp; t &lt; t_{\\text{complete}} \\\\ \\text{Completed with value} &amp; \\text{正常完成} \\\\ \\text{Completed with error} &amp; \\text{异常完成} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Future</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">状态</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Uncompleted</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（等待中）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Completed with value</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Completed with error</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">complete</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">正常完成</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">异常完成</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 创建 Future 的三种方式&#10;final f1 = Future.value(42);           // 立即以值完成（下一 microtask）&#10;final f2 = Future.error(Exception());  // 立即以错误完成&#10;final f3 = Future.delayed(            // 延迟后完成&#10;  Duration(seconds: 2),&#10;  () =&gt; &#39;delayed result&#39;,&#10;);&#10;&#10;// Future 构造函数：回调在下一个 microtask 执行&#10;final f4 = Future(() {&#10;  // 此代码不是立即执行的&#10;  return heavyComputation();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 创建 Future 的三种方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final f1 = Future.value(42);           // 立即以值完成（下一 microtask）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final f2 = Future.error(Exception());  // 立即以错误完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final f3 = Future.delayed(            // 延迟后完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Duration(seconds: 2),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  () => 'delayed result',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Future 构造函数：回调在下一个 microtask 执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final f4 = Future(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 此代码不是立即执行的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return heavyComputation();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Future 一旦完成就<strong>不可变</strong>——状态不会从 completed 变回 uncompleted，值不会被修改。这个不可变性保证是 Dart 异步安全性的基石。</p>\n<h2 id=\"async-await-的编译器转换\">async/await 的编译器转换</h2><p><code>async</code> 和 <code>await</code> 是语法糖——编译器将它们转换为 Future 链：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 开发者写的代码&#10;Future&lt;String&gt; fetchUserName(String id) async {&#10;  final response = await httpClient.get(&#39;/users/$id&#39;);&#10;  final json = await parseJson(response.body);&#10;  return json[&#39;name&#39;] as String;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 编译器生成的等价逻辑（简化）&#10;Future&lt;String&gt; fetchUserName(String id) {&#10;  return httpClient.get(&#39;/users/$id&#39;).then((response) {&#10;    return parseJson(response.body).then((json) {&#10;      return json[&#39;name&#39;] as String;&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 开发者写的代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;String> fetchUserName(String id) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final response = await httpClient.get('/users/$id');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final json = await parseJson(response.body);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return json['name'] as String;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译器生成的等价逻辑（简化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;String> fetchUserName(String id) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return httpClient.get('/users/$id').then((response) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return parseJson(response.body).then((json) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return json['name'] as String;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>await</code> 的精确语义：遇到 <code>await expr</code> 时，如果 <code>expr</code> 已经是一个 completed Future，执行<strong>仍然会让出控制权</strong>到事件循环——这是一个重要的设计决策，保证了执行顺序的可预测性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"Future&lt;void&gt; demonstration() async {&#10;  print(&#39;1&#39;);&#10;  await Future.value(42); // 即使已完成，也会让出一次&#10;  print(&#39;2&#39;);             // 在下一个 microtask 执行&#10;}&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;  demonstration();&#10;  print(&#39;3&#39;);&#10;  // 输出顺序：1, 3, 2&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> demonstration() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print('1');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await Future.value(42); // 即使已完成，也会让出一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print('2');             // 在下一个 microtask 执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  demonstration();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print('3');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 输出顺序：1, 3, 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"错误处理策略\">错误处理策略</h2><p>async/await 中的错误处理使用标准的 try-catch-finally，但需要注意 Future 错误传播的特殊行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"Future&lt;void&gt; robustFetch() async {&#10;  try {&#10;    final data = await fetchData();&#10;    await processData(data);&#10;  } on HttpException catch (e) {&#10;    // 特定异常处理&#10;    log(&#39;HTTP error: ${e.statusCode}&#39;);&#10;    await sendFallbackRequest();&#10;  } on TimeoutException {&#10;    // 超时重试&#10;    await Future.delayed(Duration(seconds: 1));&#10;    await robustFetch(); // 注意：实际应限制重试次数&#10;  } catch (e, stackTrace) {&#10;    // 兜底：记录未预期的异常&#10;    log(&#39;Unexpected error: $e\\n$stackTrace&#39;);&#10;    rethrow; // 重新抛出，让调用者决定&#10;  } finally {&#10;    // 清理资源：无论成功还是失败都执行&#10;    await closeConnection();&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> robustFetch() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final data = await fetchData();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await processData(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } on HttpException catch (e) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 特定异常处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log('HTTP error: ${e.statusCode}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await sendFallbackRequest();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } on TimeoutException {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 超时重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await Future.delayed(Duration(seconds: 1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await robustFetch(); // 注意：实际应限制重试次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } catch (e, stackTrace) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 兜底：记录未预期的异常</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log('Unexpected error: $e\\n$stackTrace');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rethrow; // 重新抛出，让调用者决定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } finally {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 清理资源：无论成功还是失败都执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await closeConnection();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>未捕获的 Future 错误通过 <code>Zone</code> 机制处理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 设置全局错误处理&#10;runZonedGuarded(() {&#10;  main(); // 应用入口&#10;}, (error, stackTrace) {&#10;  // 捕获所有未处理的异步错误&#10;  reportToErrorService(error, stackTrace);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 设置全局错误处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>runZonedGuarded(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  main(); // 应用入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, (error, stackTrace) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 捕获所有未处理的异步错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reportToErrorService(error, stackTrace);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"并发-future-组合器\">并发 Future 组合器</h2><p>当多个异步操作互相独立时，并发执行比顺序等待更高效：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// Future.wait：并发等待所有完成&#10;Future&lt;UserProfile&gt; loadProfile(String userId) async {&#10;  final results = await Future.wait([&#10;    fetchBasicInfo(userId),&#10;    fetchPreferences(userId),&#10;    fetchActivityHistory(userId),&#10;  ]);&#10;  return UserProfile(&#10;    info: results[0] as UserInfo,&#10;    prefs: results[1] as Preferences,&#10;    history: results[2] as ActivityHistory,&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用 Record 类型获得更好的类型安全&#10;Future&lt;({UserInfo info, List&lt;Order&gt; orders})&gt; loadDashboard(String id) async {&#10;  final (info, orders) = await (&#10;    fetchUserInfo(id),&#10;    fetchOrders(id),&#10;  ).wait; // Dart 3.x: Record 上的 .wait 扩展&#10;  return (info: info, orders: orders);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Future.wait：并发等待所有完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;UserProfile> loadProfile(String userId) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final results = await Future.wait([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetchBasicInfo(userId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetchPreferences(userId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetchActivityHistory(userId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return UserProfile(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    info: results[0] as UserInfo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    prefs: results[1] as Preferences,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    history: results[2] as ActivityHistory,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 Record 类型获得更好的类型安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;({UserInfo info, List&#x3C;Order> orders})> loadDashboard(String id) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final (info, orders) = await (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetchUserInfo(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetchOrders(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ).wait; // Dart 3.x: Record 上的 .wait 扩展</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (info: info, orders: orders);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合器</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>错误处理</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Future.wait(futures)</code></td>\n<td>等待所有完成</td>\n<td>首个错误时中止（默认）</td>\n<td>并行加载独立数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Future.any(futures)</code></td>\n<td>返回最快完成的</td>\n<td>首个成功即返回</td>\n<td>竞速/超时兜底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Future.forEach(items, fn)</code></td>\n<td>顺序逐个执行</td>\n<td>首个错误时中止</td>\n<td>有序批处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Future.doWhile(fn)</code></td>\n<td>循环直到返回 false</td>\n<td>错误时中止</td>\n<td>轮询/重试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"性能陷阱与最佳实践\">性能陷阱与最佳实践</h2><p>常见的性能反模式及修正方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 反模式：不必要的顺序等待&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; bad() async {&#10;  final a = await fetchA(); // 等 500ms&#10;  final b = await fetchB(); // 再等 500ms&#10;  use(a, b);                // 总计 1000ms&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 正确：并发等待独立操作&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; good() async {&#10;  final futureA = fetchA(); // 立即发起&#10;  final futureB = fetchB(); // 立即发起&#10;  final (a, b) = await (futureA, futureB).wait; // 总计 ~500ms&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 反模式：在循环中逐个 await&#10;Future&lt;List&lt;Result&gt;&gt; bad2(List&lt;String&gt; ids) async {&#10;  final results = &lt;Result&gt;[];&#10;  for (final id in ids) {&#10;    results.add(await process(id)); // N 次顺序等待&#10;  }&#10;  return results;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 正确：并发处理（注意并发量控制）&#10;Future&lt;List&lt;Result&gt;&gt; good2(List&lt;String&gt; ids) async {&#10;  return Future.wait(ids.map(process)); // N 次并发&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 反模式：不必要的顺序等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> bad() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final a = await fetchA(); // 等 500ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final b = await fetchB(); // 再等 500ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  use(a, b);                // 总计 1000ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 正确：并发等待独立操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> good() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final futureA = fetchA(); // 立即发起</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final futureB = fetchB(); // 立即发起</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final (a, b) = await (futureA, futureB).wait; // 总计 ~500ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 反模式：在循环中逐个 await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;List&#x3C;Result>> bad2(List&#x3C;String> ids) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final results = &#x3C;Result>[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (final id in ids) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    results.add(await process(id)); // N 次顺序等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return results;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 正确：并发处理（注意并发量控制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;List&#x3C;Result>> good2(List&#x3C;String> ids) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Future.wait(ids.map(process)); // N 次并发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>async/await 的黄金法则：<strong>尽早发起 Future，尽晚 await 结果</strong>。让异步操作有最大的并发窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>事件循环先清空全部 microtask 再处理一个 event，密集的 microtask 调度可能饿死 event 队列。</li>\n<li>Future 有三态且完成后不可变，这个不变性是 Dart 异步安全性的基石。</li>\n<li><code>await</code> 即使面对已完成的 Future 也会让出一次控制权，保证执行顺序可预测（<code>1, 3, 2</code> 的输出顺序）。</li>\n<li>错误处理沿用 try-catch-finally，未捕获的异步错误通过 <code>runZonedGuarded</code> 兜底。</li>\n<li>独立操作应并发等待：<code>Future.wait</code> 或 Record 上的 <code>.wait</code> 能把总耗时从累加降为最大值。</li>\n<li>黄金法则：<strong>尽早发起 Future，尽晚 await 结果</strong>；循环中逐个 await 是典型反模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参阅 <a href=\"stream-reactive\">Stream 与响应式编程</a> 了解如何处理连续的异步事件序列，以及 <a href=\"isolate-concurrency\">Isolate 并发模型</a> 了解当 async/await 不足以应对 CPU 密集任务时的解决方案。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Future 与 async/await","id":"future-与-async-await"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"事件循环的双队列模型","id":"事件循环的双队列模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Future 的三态模型","id":"future-的三态模型"},{"level":2,"text":"async/await 的编译器转换","id":"async-await-的编译器转换"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理策略","id":"错误处理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"并发 Future 组合器","id":"并发-future-组合器"},{"level":2,"text":"性能陷阱与最佳实践","id":"性能陷阱与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模式匹配与 Records","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/pattern-matching-records"},"next":{"title":"Stream 与响应式编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/stream-reactive"}}